OL,3,AMbappe sorry for 'ill-judged' Mao
OL,4,Aremark after backlash in China
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe meme is part of a running joke
OL,7,Fabout the Real Madrid forward being
OL,8,Fcalled a "dictator" because of his huge
OL,9,Finfluence in football.
OL,11,F"My comment was ill-judged, and I now
OL,12,Funderstand that it hurt many people in
OL,13,FChina and in Chinese communities around
OL,14,Fthe world," Mbappe said in a statement.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
